# The box's build context (sandbox/box/Dockerfile): only what the image's build reads, the same files as its tag
# (sandbox/box/tag.mjs). The tools come from the internet; from here only the manifests the third-party crates are
# compiled from, and the script that compiles them. Never our code.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!**/Cargo.toml
!sandbox/box/deps.sh
# what the tag (sandbox/box/tag.mjs) leaves out too, wherever it is
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.lake
**/runs
**/dist
**/deliverables
